 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "WordFrequencyTracker() starts with no words. addText(text) adds the words of text (maximal runs of ASCII letters, lowercased) to the running counts; a word never continues across two addText calls. getTop10() returns up to 10 pairs [word, count] for the counts so far, by descending count, ties by ascending word, and changes nothing. Every method call is answered in call order on one instance; void methods return nothing.",
